        "state": "COMMENTED",
        "body": "**Actionable comments posted: 0**\n\n<details>\n<summary>⚠️ Outside diff range comments (1)</summary><blockquote>\n\n<details>\n<summary>src/orders/split.ts (1)</summary><blockquote>\n\n`4-9`: **`splitCharges` assumes a positive amount.**\n\n`Math.ceil(amountCents / maxCents)` is negative when `amountCents` is below zero, and `new Array(count)` then throws `RangeError: Invalid array length`. With an amount of exactly zero, `count` is 0 and the function writes to index `-1`. `planCharges` in `src/orders/checkout.ts` now passes `order.totalCents - giftCardCents`, which is zero or negative whenever the gift card balance covers the order.\n\n</blockquote></details>\n\n</blockquote></details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>📜 Review details</summary>\n\n**Configuration used: defaults**\n**Review profile: CHILL**\n\n<details>\n<summary>📥 Commits</summary>\n\nReviewing files that changed from the base of the PR and between 6b1e0a4 and b07d4e2.\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>📒 Files selected for processing (2)</summary>\n\n* `src/giftcards/types.ts` (1 hunks)\n* `src/orders/checkout.ts` (1 hunks)\n\n</details>\n\n</details>",
